WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:02,040
Mother

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,500
I've said it several times

3
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,830
I won't gamble anymore

4
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:08,280
I believed your evil

5
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:10,650
Can you still believe it if you are a gambler?

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,300
I'll give you fifty dollars

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,460
You keep the flowers for yourself

8
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,480
I won't throw this money on the card table

9
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,760
I really have a serious business keeping them here

10
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,880
I've finally passed this test.

11
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:38,030
This is pocket money for you

12
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,830
You can buy whatever you want

13
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:42,800
I have been with Zhang Jianguo for so many years

14
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,160
This is the first time I have received money from him.

15
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,900
If people live longer

16
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,100
You can encounter anything really

17
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:54,500
I never thought that one day

18
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:56,580
I can still spend your Zhang Jianguo money

19
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:00,420
Gradually, he became the same tough-talking person as always.

20
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:03,750
It’s also my fault that I was too dull before

21
00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:05,190
You didn't argue with me

22
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:10,950
Could it be that this gambler has really changed for the better? What is he thinking?

23
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:13,830
They say dogs can’t change from eating shit.

24
00:01:14,270 --> 00:01:15,590
I want the gambler to change his ways

25
00:01:15,710 --> 00:01:16,750
It’s even more difficult

26
00:01:18,010 --> 00:01:20,170
What should I buy for Erya with the money?

27
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:23,110
Waiting for the typhoon to pass

28
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:29,140
I will use this money to buy a pack of seafood fish for Sanya.
